# GEA3-U3a source-level rows. Each call forces the public decode entry
# signature to resolve its static F32 shapes at T=1 with the L_max=76 KV
# geometry (fixed-capacity buffers, selected-row append, declared-length
# additive mask). The attention family is batched over five KV heads and
# three query heads per KV head; these rows make no lowering, Metal, or device
# execution
# claim; the target gate separately rejects host-shaped constructs in the
# @ kernel bodies (no failable bodies, list empty/append, get/coalesce, or
# in-body function calls — the GEA1 metal-text gate vocabulary).

